    "title": "STATE OF MICHIGAN PROBATE COURT COUNTY OF LAPEER NOTICE TO CREDITORS Decedent's Estate File No.: 26-042342-DE JUDGE DENIS J. McCARTHY - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Guest ,\n1 days ago Estate of Michael William Jackson. Date of birth: March 18, 1966. Notice to creditors: The decedent, Michael William Jackson, died March 30, 2026. Creditors of the decedent are notified that all claims against the estate will be forever barred unless presented to Michele Jackson, personal representative, or to both the probate court at 255 Clay Street, Lapeer, MI 48446 and the personal representative within 4 months after the date of publication of this notice. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
